  unitName: Countess Lavinia (EU)
  unitId: 760144
  unitNumber: 7076
  description: Countess Lavinia of the Shadows Whispering is the best of all the
    Noblesse. Nobody is afraid of her spies or influence. Her spiders are powerful
    and here to help all people. Nobody has been threatened in the writing of this
    description.
  summonDesc: My spies are not lying. You're strong, strong enough to summon me.
  fusionDesc: As far as my web extends, I can hear, see and plot.
  evoDesc: I will accept these new responsibilities.
